eight:400;color:var(--band-uses-ink)" type="button"><span class="use-case-rule block">Form Filling</span></button><button aria-describedby="_R_956ltfb_-11" class="group absolute top-0 left-0 cursor-default opacity-0 rounded-[var(--radius-button)] px-[0.3em] py-[0.06em] leading-[1.15] whitespace-nowrap data-[hot]:z-10 font-sans" data-pressable="false" data-use-case="" style="font-size:33px;font-weight:400;color:var(--band-uses-ink)" type="button"><span class="use-case-rule block">Travel Booking</span></button></div><div class="sr-only"><span id="_R_956ltfb_-0">Give agents a real browser to navigate, click and type through the web, then hand back what they found.</span><span id="_R_956ltfb_-1">Gather fresh, clean web data at scale to train and evaluate models.</span><span id="_R_956ltfb_-2">Search stores, compare prices and fill a cart on a shopper&#x27;s behalf.</span><span id="_R_956ltfb_-3">Pull structured data from any site, logins and JavaScript included, without running a fleet of your own.</span><span id="_R_956ltfb_-4">Automate the clicks and forms people repeat every day in web apps with no API.</span><span id="_R_956ltfb_-5">Research accounts, enrich leads and keep the CRM current, straight from the source.</span><span id="_R_956ltfb_-6">Run end-to-end tests in real browsers and catch what breaks before your users do.</span><span id="_R_956ltfb_-7">Resolve tickets end to end: look up orders, update accounts and follow up in the tools support already uses.</span><span id="_R_956ltfb_-8">Read dozens of sources in parallel and come back with an answer and its citations.</span><span id="_R_956ltfb_-9">Track prices and stock across retailers, on a schedule or the moment they change.</span><span id="_R_956ltfb_-10">Complete applications, sign-ups and checkouts from the data you already have.</span><span id="_R_956ltfb_-11">Search flights and hotels across sites and book the one that fits.</span></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 left-0 z-20 rounded-[var(--radius-button)] px-4 py-3 font-sans leading-[1.5] transition-[opacity,scale] duration-(--duration-dropdown) ease-out data-[instant]:duration-0" data-use-case-tip="" style="width:340px;font-size:14px;background:var(--band-uses-ink);color:var(--band-uses);opacity:0;scale:0.97"><span data-hug=""><span class="relative">Give agents a real browser to navigate, click and type through the web, then hand back what they found.</span></span></div></div></div><div class="relative mt-8 md:hidden"><ul class="layout-grid"><li class="col-span-full border-t-[0.5px] py-5 first:border-t-0" style="border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 25%, transparent)"><p class="text-(length:--text-term) leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] font-sans" style="font-weight:400">AI Agents</p><p class="mt-2 font-sans text-[14px] leading-[1.5]" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 70%, transparent)">Give agents a real browser to navigate, click and type through the web, then hand back what they found.</p></li><li class="col-span-full border-t-[0.5px] py-5 first:border-t-0" style="border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 25%, transparent)"><p class="text-(length:--text-term) leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] font-sans" style="font-weight:400">Foundational Model Training</p><p class="mt-2 font-sans text-[14px] leading-[1.5]" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 70%, transparent)">Gather fresh, clean web data at scale to train and evaluate models.</p></li><li class="col-span-full border-t-[0.5px] py-5 first:border-t-0" style="border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 25%, transparent)"><p class="text-(length:--text-term) leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] font-sans" style="font-weight:400">AI Shopping Assistants</p><p class="mt-2 font-sans text-[14px] leading-[1.5]" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 70%, transparent)">Search stores, compare prices and fill a cart on a shopper&#x27;s behalf.</p></li><li class="col-span-full border-t-[0.5px] py-5 first:border-t-0" style="border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 25%, transparent)"><p class="text-(length:--text-term) leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] font-sans" style="font-weight:400">Web Scraping</p><p class="mt-2 font-sans text-[14px] leading-[1.5]" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 70%, transparent)">Pull structured data from any site, logins and JavaScript included, without running a fleet of your own.</p></li><li class="col-span-full border-t-[0.5px] py-5 first:border-t-0" style="border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 25%, transparent)"><p class="text-(length:--text-term) leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] font-sans" style="font-weight:400">RPA Software</p><p class="mt-2 font-sans text-[14px] leading-[1.5]" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 70%, transparent)">Automate the clicks and forms people repeat every day in web apps with no API.</p></li><li class="col-span-full border-t-[0.5px] py-5 first:border-t-0" style="border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 25%, transparent)"><p class="text-(length:--text-term) leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] font-sans" style="font-weight:400">Sales Automation</p><p class="mt-2 font-sans text-[14px] leading-[1.5]" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 70%, transparent)">Research accounts, enrich leads and keep the CRM current, straight from the source.</p></li><li class="col-span-full border-t-[0.5px] py-5 first:border-t-0" style="border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 25%, transparent)"><p class="text-(length:--text-term) leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] font-sans" style="font-weight:400">QA Software</p><p class="mt-2 font-sans text-[14px] leading-[1.5]" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 70%, transparent)">Run end-to-end tests in real browsers and catch what breaks before your users do.</p></li><li class="col-span-full border-t-[0.5px] py-5 first:border-t-0" style="border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 25%, transparent)"><p class="text-(length:--text-term) leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] font-sans" style="font-weight:400">Customer Service Agents</p><p class="mt-2 font-sans text-[14px] leading-[1.5]" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 70%, transparent)">Resolve tickets end to end: look up orders, update accounts and follow up in the tools support already uses.</p></li><li class="col-span-full border-t-[0.5px] py-5 first:border-t-0" style="border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 25%, transparent)"><p class="text-(length:--text-term) leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] font-sans" style="font-weight:400">Deep Research</p><p class="mt-2 font-sans text-[14px] leading-[1.5]" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 70%, transparent)">Read dozens of sources in parallel and come back with an answer and its citations.</p></li><li class="col-span-full border-t-[0.5px] py-5 first:border-t-0" style="border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 25%, transparent)"><p class="text-(length:--text-term) leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] font-sans" style="font-weight:400">Price Monitoring</p><p class="mt-2 font-sans text-[14px] leading-[1.5]" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 70%, transparent)">Track prices and stock across retailers, on a schedule or the moment they change.</p></li><li class="col-span-full border-t-[0.5px] py-5 first:border-t-0" style="border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 25%, transparent)"><p class="text-(length:--text-term) leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] font-sans" style="font-weight:400">Form Filling</p><p class="mt-2 font-sans text-[14px] leading-[1.5]" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 70%, transparent)">Complete applications, sign-ups and checkouts from the data you already have.</p></li><li class="col-span-full border-t-[0.5px] py-5 first:border-t-0" style="border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 25%, transparent)"><p class="text-(length:--text-term) leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] font-sans" style="font-weight:400">Travel Booking</p><p class="mt-2 font-sans text-[14px] leading-[1.5]" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--band-uses-ink) 70%, transparent)">Search flights and hotels across sites and book the one that fits.</p></li></ul></div></div></section><section id="sessions-api" class="mt-32 max-md:mt-12 max-md:[--block-gap:32px]"><div class="layout-grid"><div class="col-span-full" data-hook="sessions-api-title"><h2 class="font-sans text-[40px] leading-[1.05] font-[360] text-balance text-[var(--text)] max-md:text-[32px]">AI Agents were never meant to browse the web.<br/>Steel enables your Agents to browse like humans.</h2></div></div><div class="mt-16 max-md:mt-12"><div class="group layout-grid"><div class="col-span-full md:col-span-4 xl:col-span-6  md:pe-10 xl:pe-[calc(100%-510px)]" style="--icon-ink:var(--picture-sessions-icon, var(--picture-sessions-cta, var(--picture-sessions-ink)))"><div data-lead=""><h3 class="font-sans text-[24px] leading-[1.3] font-[360]" style="color:var(--text)"><span class="block [text-wrap:pretty]">Control and start sessions with Sessions API</span> <span class="block text-[var(--text-dim)]">A real browser, one API call.</span></h3></div><ul class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-6 xl:grid-cols-2 text-[var(--text)]"><li><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.5]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block bg-current size-5 shrink-0 text-[var(--icon-ink,var(--text-dim))]" style="mask-image:url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2024%2024%22%3E%3Cmask%20id%3D%22m%22%20maskUnits%3D%22userSpaceOnUse%22%20x%3D%220%22%20y%3D%220%22%20width%3D%2224%22%20height%3D%2224%22%3E%3Cg%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%20stroke%3D%22%23fff%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22square%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22miter%22%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M20%2013C20%2017.4183%2016.4183%2021%2012%2021C7.5817%2021%204%2017.4183%204%2013C4%208.5817%207.5817%205%2012%205C16.4183%205%2020%208.5817%2020%2013Z%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20fill%3D%22none%22%20d%3D%22M10%202H14%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3Cg%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%23000%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22square%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22miter%22%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M12%2013L9%2010%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3Cg%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3C%2Fmask%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%2224%22%20height%3D%2224%22%20mask%3D%22url(%23m)%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E&quot;);-webkit-mask-image:url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2024%2024%22%3E%3Cmask%20id%3D%22m%22%20maskUnits%3D%22userSpaceOnUse%22%20x%3D%220%22%20y%3D%220%22%20width%3D%2224%22%20height%3D%2224%22%3E%3Cg%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%20stroke%3D%22%23fff%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22square%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22miter%22%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M20%2013C20%2017.4183%2016.4183%2021%2012%2021C7.5817%2021%204%2017.4183%204%2013C4%208.5817%207.5817%205%2012%205C16.4183%205%2020%208.5817%2020%2013Z%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20fill%3D%22none%22%20d%3D%22M10%202H14%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3Cg%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%23000%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22square%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22miter%22%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M12%2013L9%2010%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3Cg%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3C%2Fmask%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%2224%22%20height%3D%2224%22%20mask%3D%22url(%23m)%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E&quot;);mask-size:100% 100%;-webkit-mask-size:100% 100%;mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat"></span>Start a session in &lt;1s</div><p class="mt-1.5 line-clamp-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.5] font-description text-[color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor_60%,transparent)]">A fresh browser ready before your agent asks twice.</p></li><li><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.5]"><span aria-hidden="true"