 justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-6 max-md:flex-col max-md:items-start"><h2 class="font-sans text-[40px] leading-[1.05] font-[360] text-balance max-md:text-[32px]">FAQ</h2><a class="nav-login inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-[0.4em] font-mono text-[12px] leading-4 font-[440] text-[var(--text)] uppercase mb-1.5 max-md:hidden" data-arrow-link="" href="/faq"><span class="nav-underline">View all FAQs</span><svg aria-hidden="true" class="nav-login-arrow -me-[0.15em] size-[1em]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"></path></svg></a></div><div class="col-span-full mt-12 max-md:mt-8"><div><ul class="group/faq border-t-[0.5px] " style="border-color:var(--line-subtle)"><li class="border-b-[0.5px]" style="border-color:var(--line-subtle)"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_ud6ltfb_-0" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left font-sans text-[length:var(--faq-question-size,20px)] leading-[1.4] tracking-[-0.02em] max-md:text-[16px]" data-pressable="false" id="_R_ud6ltfb_-0-label" type="button">What is Steel and what does it do?<span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-4 shrink-0 opacity-80"><span class="absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 h-4 w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-[rotate] duration-200 ease-out group-data-[instant]/faq:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-none "></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_ud6ltfb_-0-label" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-200 ease-out group-data-[instant]/faq:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-[opacity]" id="_R_ud6ltfb_-0" inert="" role="region" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;opacity:0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-[44rem] pb-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] font-description" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--text) 60%, transparent)">Steel is cloud browser infrastructure for AI agents. It gives agents isolated cloud browser sessions with built-in anti-bot stealth, CAPTCHA solving and session persistence.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b-[0.5px]" style="border-color:var(--line-subtle)"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_ud6ltfb_-1" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left font-sans text-[length:var(--faq-question-size,20px)] leading-[1.4] tracking-[-0.02em] max-md:text-[16px]" data-pressable="false" id="_R_ud6ltfb_-1-label" type="button">Is Steel open source?<span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-4 shrink-0 opacity-80"><span class="absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 h-4 w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-[rotate] duration-200 ease-out group-data-[instant]/faq:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-none "></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_ud6ltfb_-1-label" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-200 ease-out group-data-[instant]/faq:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-[opacity]" id="_R_ud6ltfb_-1" inert="" role="region" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;opacity:0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-[44rem] pb-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] font-description" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--text) 60%, transparent)">Yes. Steel Browser is the open-source server on GitHub that you can host yourself. Steel Cloud is the managed version, adding scale, stealth, proxies and CAPTCHA solving.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b-[0.5px]" style="border-color:var(--line-subtle)"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_ud6ltfb_-2" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left font-sans text-[length:var(--faq-question-size,20px)] leading-[1.4] tracking-[-0.02em] max-md:text-[16px]" data-pressable="false" id="_R_ud6ltfb_-2-label" type="button">Can I use Steel with Playwright, Puppeteer or Selenium?<span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-4 shrink-0 opacity-80"><span class="absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 h-4 w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-[rotate] duration-200 ease-out group-data-[instant]/faq:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-none "></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_ud6ltfb_-2-label" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-200 ease-out group-data-[instant]/faq:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-[opacity]" id="_R_ud6ltfb_-2" inert="" role="region" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;opacity:0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-[44rem] pb-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] font-description" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--text) 60%, transparent)">Yes. Steel works with Playwright, Puppeteer, Selenium and its own Node and Python SDKs. You connect over a standard CDP WebSocket URL, so any CDP-compatible tool works out of the box.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b-[0.5px]" style="border-color:var(--line-subtle)"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_ud6ltfb_-3" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left font-sans text-[length:var(--faq-question-size,20px)] leading-[1.4] tracking-[-0.02em] max-md:text-[16px]" data-pressable="false" id="_R_ud6ltfb_-3-label" type="button">How fast does Steel start a browser session?<span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-4 shrink-0 opacity-80"><span class="absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 h-4 w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-[rotate] duration-200 ease-out group-data-[instant]/faq:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-none "></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_ud6ltfb_-3-label" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-200 ease-out group-data-[instant]/faq:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-[opacity]" id="_R_ud6ltfb_-3" inert="" role="region" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;opacity:0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-[44rem] pb-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] font-description" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--text) 60%, transparent)">Under a second on average, with no cold-start penalty. Each session launches into its own isolated Chromium in the cloud, with its proxy, cookies and storage already set up.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b-[0.5px]" style="border-color:var(--line-subtle)"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_ud6ltfb_-4" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left font-sans text-[length:var(--faq-question-size,20px)] leading-[1.4] tracking-[-0.02em] max-md:text-[16px]" data-pressable="false" id="_R_ud6ltfb_-4-label" type="button">Can Steel bypass CAPTCHAs?<span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-4 shrink-0 opacity-80"><span class="absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 h-4 w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-[rotate] duration-200 ease-out group-data-[instant]/faq:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-none "></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_ud6ltfb_-4-label" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-200 ease-out group-data-[instant]/faq:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-[opacity]" id="_R_ud6ltfb_-4" inert="" role="region" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;opacity:0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-[44rem] pb-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] font-description" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--text) 60%, transparent)">Yes, on Steel Cloud. With CAPTCHA solving on, a session detects and solves CAPTCHAs as your agent browses, including Cloudflare Turnstile, PerimeterX press-and-hold and image CAPTCHAs, and the CAPTCHAs API reports each one&#x27;s progress. Stealth and proxies keep many from appearing at all.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b-[0.5px]" style="border-color:var(--line-subtle)"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_ud6ltfb_-5" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left font-sans text-[length:var(--faq-question-size,20px)] leading-[1.4] tracking-[-0.02em] max-md:text-[16px]" data-pressable="false" id="_R_ud6ltfb_-5-label" type="button">Does Steel support human-in-the-loop workflows and reusing logins?<span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-4 shrink-0 opacity-80"><span class="absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 h-4 w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-[rotate] duration-200 ease-out group-data-[instant]/faq:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-none "></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_ud6ltfb_-5-label" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-200 ease-out group-data-[instant]/faq:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-[opacity]" id="_R_ud6ltfb_-5" inert="" role="region" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;opacity:0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-[44rem] pb-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] font-description" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--text) 60%, transparent)">Yes. A live session viewer lets people watch or take over running sessions. Persistent browser profiles keep cookies and session tokens, so agents pick up signed-in workflows without logging in again.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b-[0.5px]" style="border-color:var(--line-subtle)"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_ud6ltfb_-6" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left font-sans text-[length:var(--faq-question-size,20px)] leading-[1.4] tracking-[-0.02em] max-md:text-[16px]" data-pressable="false" id="_R_ud6ltfb_-6-label" type="button">How much does Steel cost, and is there a free tier?<span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-4 shrink-0 opacity-80"><span class="absolute top-1/2 left-0 h-px w-4 -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 h-4 w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-[rotate] duration-200 ease-out group-data-[instant]/faq:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-none "></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_ud6ltfb_-6-label" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-200 ease-out group-data-[instant]/faq:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-[opacity]" id="_R_ud6ltfb_-6" inert="" role="region" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;opacity:0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-[44rem] pb-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] font-description" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--text) 60%, transparent)">Launch includes $30 free credits, no monthly fee, and usage-based pricing after your one-time credits run out. Scale is $250 per month plus usage, and Enterprise pricing is custom. Steel Browser is free and open source.</p></div></div></li></ul></div><a class="nav-login inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-[0.4em] font-mono text-[12px] leading-4 font-[440] text-[var(--text)] uppercase mt-8 md:hidden" data-arrow-link="" href="/faq"><span class="nav-underline">View all FAQs</span><svg aria-hidden="true" class="nav-login-arrow -me-[0.15em] size-[1em]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="mb-16 text-[var(--text)] max-md:mb-12" data-hook="blog-snippet"><div class="layout-grid"><div class="col-span-full flex items-end justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-6 max-md:flex-col max-md:items-start"><h2 class="font-sans text-[40px] leading-[1.05] font-[360] text-balance max-md:text-[32px]">Blog</h2><div class="shrink-0 pb-1.5"><a class="nav-login inline-flex items-center gap-[0.4em] font-mono text-[12px] leading-4 font-[440] text-[var(--arrow-ink,var(--text))] uppercase" data-arrow-link="" href="/blog"><span class="nav-underline">View all blogs</span><svg aria-hidden="true" class="nav-login-arrow -me-[0.15em] size-[1em]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="mt-12 max-md:mt-8"><ul class="layout-grid relative gap-y-[var(--grid-gap)]" style="--blog-dim:0.85"><li class="col-span-4" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><a class="blog-card flex aspect-square flex-col justify-between gap-6 rounded-[var(--radius-button)] p-6 max-md:aspect-auto  " data-pressable="false" data-square="" style="background:var(--cover-d7f0ff, #D7F0FF);color:var(--cover-ink-d7f0ff, #05A5FF);--card-edge:var(--cover-edge-d7f0ff)" href="/blog/build-the-agent-not-its-computer"><div><p class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 font-mono text-[12px] leading-4 font-[440] uppercase"><time>Oct 7, 2026</time><span style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--cover-ink-d7f0ff, #05A5FF) 65%, transparent)">19 min read</span></p><h3 class="mt-3 font-sans text-[26px] leading-[1.3] font-[360] text-balance" data-card-title="">Build the agent. Don’t build its computer.</h3></div><p class="line-clamp-2 text-[16px] leading-[1.5] font-description" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--cover-ink-d7f0ff, #05A5FF) 80%, transparent)">Should you build or buy AI agent infrastructure? Specify the computer your agent needs, test how an agent sandbox recovers, and start managed. Includes a provider map.</p></a></li><li class="col-span-4" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><a class="blog-card flex aspect-square flex-col justify-between gap-6 rounded-[var(--radius-button)] p-6 max-md:aspect-auto  " data-pressable="false" data-square="" style="background:var(--cover-793387, #793387);color:var(--cover-ink-793387, #F9EB73);--card-edge:var(--cover-edge-793387)" href="/blog/developer-tools-come-with-an-assembly-required-sticker"><div><p class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 font-mono text-[12px] leading-4 font-[440] uppercase"><time>Jul 30, 2026</time><span style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--cover-ink-793387, #F9EB73) 65%, transparent)">6 min read</span></p><h3 class="mt-3 font-sans text-[26px] leading-[1.3] font-[360] text-balance" data-card-title="">Developer tools come with an assembly required sticker</h3></div><p class="line-clamp-2 text-[16px] leading-[1.5] font-description" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--cover-ink-793387, #F9EB73) 80%, transparent)">Customer-supplied proxies failed 22x more often than managed ones; the harder problem was explaining that inside our own product.</p></a></li><li class="col-span-4" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><a class="blog-card flex aspect-square flex-col justify-between gap-6 rounded-[var(--radius-button)] p-6 max-md:aspect-auto  " data-pressable="false" data-square="" style="background:var(--cover-d7f0ff, #D7F0FF);color:var(--cover-ink-d7f0ff, #05A5FF);--card-edge:var(--cover-edge-d7f0ff)" href="/blog/hermes-steel-plugin"><div><p class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 font-mono text-[12px] leading-4 font-[440] uppercase"><time>Jul 22, 2026</time><span style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--cover-ink-d7f0ff, #05A5FF) 65%, transparent)">3 min read</span></p><h3 class="mt-3 font-sans text-[26px] leading-[1.3] font-[360] text-balance" data-card-title="">Steel now ships as a browser plugin for Hermes Agent</h3></div><p class="line-clamp-2 text-[16px] leading-[1.5] font-description" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--cover-ink-d7f0ff, #05A5FF) 80%, transparent)">Give Hermes Agent a Steel cloud browser in two commands, with live session viewing, page extraction, and per-site proxy and CAPTCHA controls built in.</p></a></li><li class="col-span-4" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><a class="blog-card flex aspect-square flex-col justify-between gap-6 rounded-[var(--radius-button)] p-6 max-md:aspect-auto  " data-pressable="false" data-square="" style="background:var(--cover-80aa40, #80AA40);color:var(--cover-ink-80aa40, #000000);--card-edge:var(--cover-edge-80aa40)" href="/blog/steel-browser-is-live-in-stripe-projects"><div><p class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 font-mono text-[12px] leading-4 font-[440] uppercase"><time>Jul 15, 2026</time><span style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--cover-ink-80aa40, #000000) 65%, transparent)">3 min read</span></p><h3 class="mt-3 font-sans text-[26px] leading-[1.3] font-[360] text-balance" data-card-title="">Steel Browser is live in Stripe Projects</h3></div><p class="line-clamp-2 text-[16px] leading-[1.5] font-description" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--cover-ink-80aa40, #000000) 80%, transparent)">Steel Browser is live in Stripe Projects, giving agents on-demand cloud browser sessions for live web work.</p></a></li><li class="col-span-4" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><a class="blog-card flex aspect-square flex-col justify-between gap-6 rounded-[var(--radius-button)] p-6 max-md:aspect-auto  " data-pressable="false" data-square="" style="background:var(--cover-df8120, #DF8120);color:var(--cover-ink-df8120, #FDFDFC);--card-edge:var(--cover-edge-df8120)" href="/blog/launch-week-v3-recap"><div><p class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 font-mono text-[12px] leading-4 font-[440] uppercase"><time>Jun 29, 2026</time><span style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--cover-ink-df8120, #FDFDFC) 65%, transparent)">3 min read</span></p><h3 class="mt-3 font-sans text-[26px] leading-[1.3] font-[360] text-balance" data-card-title="">Launch Week v3: everything we shipped</h3></div><p class="line-clamp-2 text-[16px] leading-[1.5] font-description" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--cover-ink-df8120, #FDFDFC) 80%, transparent)">Launch Week v3 recap: Stealth Browser, Dedicated IPs, native Rust and Go SDKs, Atlas, and pricing updates for production agent workloads running on Steel.</p></a></li><li class="col-span-4" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><a class="blog-card flex aspect-square flex-col justify-between gap-6 rounded-[var(--radius-button)] p-6 max-md:aspect-auto  " data-pressable="false" data-square="" style="background:var(--cover-05a5ff, #05A5FF);color:var(--cover-ink-05a5ff, #F4DD15);--card-edge:var(--cover-edge-05a5ff)" href="/blog/pricing-update"><div><p class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 font-mono text-[12px] leading-4 font-[440] uppercase"><time>Jun 26, 2026</time><span style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--cover-ink-05a5ff, #F4DD15) 65%, transparent)">3 min read</span></p><h3 class="mt-3 font-sans text-[26px] leading-[1.3] font-[360] text-balance" data-card-title="">Simpler pricing, built for how agents run</h3></div><p class="line-clamp-2 text-[16px] leading-[1.5] font-description" style="color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--cover-ink-05a5ff, #F4DD15) 80%, transparent)">Steel pricing now has Launch, Scale, and Enterprise plans with metered browser rates, usage credits, visible usage, and plan limits for agent workloads.</p></a></li></ul></div></section><section class="relative isolate py-[122px] max-md:py-[69px]" data-hook="github-band" data-nav-ink="var(--hero-ink)" style="background:var(--band-hero);color:var(--hero-ink);--text:var(--hero-ink)"><div class="layout-grid relative z-10"><div class="col-span-full flex flex-col items-start md:col-span-6 md:row-start-1" data-cta-words=""><h2 class="max-w-[24ch] font-sans text-[40px] leading-[1.05] font-[360] text-balance text-[var(--text)] max-md:text-[32px]">We believe the future of browser automation is open source.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] font-description" style="color:var(--text)"><span style="color:var(--hero-copy-lead, var(--heading-lead))">Steel Browser is built in the open on GitHub.</span><br/><span style="color:var(--hero-copy-lead, var(--heading-lead))">Run it yourself, read every line, and help shape what comes next.</span></p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 max-md:self-stretch" style="--button-primary:var(--closing-cta-primary-ground);--tint-bg:var(--closing-cta-primary-ink)"><a class="steel-button inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-[var(--radius-button)] px-3 text-[12px] leading-4 font-mono font-[440] uppercase whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-150 ease-out max-md:w-full bg-[var(--button-primary)] text-[var(--tint-bg)] hover:bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--button-primary)_88%,var(--tint-bg))] h-9 pe-[9px]" href="https://app.steel.dev/sign-up">Start Free<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-2 inline-grid h-[18px] min-w-[18px] place-items-center rounded-[calc(var(--radius-button)/2)] bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor_14%,transparent)] px-1 text-[11px] leading-none max-md:hidden">S</span></a><a class="steel-button inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-[var(--radius-button)] px-3 text-[12px] leading-4 font-mono font-[440] uppercase whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-150 ease-out max-md:w-full border-[0.5px] border-[var(--button-edge)] bg-[var(--button-secondary)] text-[var(--brand-ink)] shadow-[0_1px_2px_0_color-mix(in_srgb,color-mix(in_oklab,var(--button-secondary)_45%,var(--brand-ink))_12%,transparent),0_0_0_1px_color-mix(in_srgb,color-mix(in_oklab,var(--button-secondary)_45%,var(--brand-ink))_8%,transparent)] hover:bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--button-secondary)_88%,var(--brand-ink))] h-9 pe-[9px]" data-pressable="true" href="https://github.com/steel-dev/steel-browser" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="--button-secondary:var(--closing-cta-secondary-ground, #fdfdfc);--brand-ink:var(--closing-cta-secondary-ink, #000000);--button-edge:var(--closing-cta-secondary-edge, var(--sand-6))" target="_blank" data-shortcut="g" aria-keyshortcuts="G">View GitHub repository<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-2 inline-grid h-[18px] min-w-[18px] place-items-center rounded-[calc(var(--radius-button)/2)] bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor_14%,transparent)] px-1 text-[11px] leading-none max-md:hidden">G</span></a></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" data-envelope-reach=""><svg aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 block size-full" preserveAspectRatio