"@type":"Answer","text":"Steel is cloud browser infrastructure for AI agents. It gives agents isolated cloud browser sessions with built-in anti-bot stealth, CAPTCHA solving and session persistence."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Steel open source?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Steel Browser is the open-source server on GitHub that you can host yourself. Steel Cloud is the managed version, adding scale, stealth, proxies and CAPTCHA solving."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use Steel with Playwright, Puppeteer or Selenium?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Steel works with Playwright, Puppeteer, Selenium and its own Node and Python SDKs. You connect over a standard CDP WebSocket URL, so any CDP-compatible tool works out of the box."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How fast does Steel start a browser session?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Under a second on average, with no cold-start penalty. Each session launches into its own isolated Chromium in the cloud, with its proxy, cookies and storage already set up."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Steel bypass CAPTCHAs?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, on Steel Cloud. With CAPTCHA solving on, a session detects and solves CAPTCHAs as your agent browses, including Cloudflare Turnstile, PerimeterX press-and-hold and image CAPTCHAs, and the CAPTCHAs API reports each one's progress. Stealth and proxies keep many from appearing at all."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Steel support human-in-the-loop workflows and reusing logins?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. A live session viewer lets people watch or take over running sessions. Persistent browser profiles keep cookies and session tokens, so agents pick up signed-in workflows without logging in again."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does Steel cost, and is there a free tier?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Launch includes $30 free credits, no monthly fee, and usage-based pricing after your one-time credits run out. Scale is $250 per month plus usage, and Enterprise pricing is custom. Steel Browser is free and open source."}}]}]}</script><!--$--><!--/$--><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute z-0 overflow-hidden" style="top:0;left:0;width:0;height:0;visibility:hidden"></div><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0ne5wmdqb31eg.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n4:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1tf2pn9278k7y.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n5:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n7:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1tf2pn9278k7y.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n9:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1tf2pn9278k7y.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\nb:I[68027,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3jbmnjw52m8et.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2i3199fuqs76b.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/28346eo8wd077.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/38liju9rh5xcx.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/35h7rce85deob.js\"],\"default\",1]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0d4fd-m3k7t1w.css\",\"style\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2h7lzq4dnc9cr.css\",\"style\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3xefejrspg796.css\",\"style\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/immutable/media/ABCSchengenAMono_Variable.p.1vh0uvnfona6i.woff2\",\"font\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\",\"type\":\"font/woff2\"}]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/immutable/media/ABCSchengenA_Variable-s.p.3nb4eiitxra8w.woff2\",\"font\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\",\"type\":\"font/woff2\"}]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3fwj2bmxstasx.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"P\":null,\"c\":[\"\",\"\"],\"q\":\"\",\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4096]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4112],[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0d4fd-m3k7t1w.css\",\"precedence\"