n-demand cloud browser sessions for live web work.\",\"date\":\"2026-07-15\",\"category\":\"Product\",\"launchWeek\":\"$undefined\",\"authors\":[\"nikola-balic\"],\"minutes\":3,\"cover\":{\"ground\":\"#80AA40\",\"ink\":\"#000000\"},\"image\":\"$undefined\"},{\"slug\":\"launch-week-v3-recap\",\"title\":\"Launch Week v3: everything we shipped\",\"description\":\"Launch Week v3 recap: Stealth Browser, Dedicated IPs, native Rust and Go SDKs, Atlas, and pricing updates for production agent workloads running on Steel.\",\"date\":\"2026-06-29\",\"category\":\"Product\",\"launchWeek\":\"v3\",\"authors\":[\"nikola-balic\"],\"minutes\":3,\"cover\":{\"ground\":\"#DF8120\",\"ink\":\"#FDFDFC\"},\"image\":\"$undefined\"},{\"slug\":\"pricing-update\",\"title\":\"Simpler pricing, built for how agents run\",\"description\":\"Steel pricing now has Launch, Scale, and Enterprise plans with metered browser rates, usage credits, visible usage, and plan limits for agent workloads.\",\"date\":\"2026-06-26\",\"category\":\"Product\",\"launchWeek\":\"v3\",\"authors\":[\"hussien-hussien\"],\"minutes\":3,\"cover\":{\"ground\":\"#05A5FF\",\"ink\":\"#F4DD15\"},\"image\":\"$undefined\"}],\"tone\":\"$undefined\"}]}]]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"pt-12 pb-12 overflow-hidden pt-24! pb-0!\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--page-ink)\",\"backgroundColor\":\"var(--bg)\"},\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[calc(var(--page-width)_+_2*var(--grid-margin))] px-[var(--grid-margin)]\",\"children\":[\"$undefined\",[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"contents\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 items-start gap-x-8 gap-y-10 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"Product\",{\"className\":\"[\u0026_a]:text-[14px] [\u0026_a]:leading-[20px] [\u0026_h2]:text-[14px] [\u0026_h2]:leading-[20px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[24px] font-description\",\"data-face\":\"